OL,3,GNEWSACalls to save tree near Paul
OL,4,AMcCartney home
OL,5,
OL,6,FNeighbours accepted it should be
OL,7,Fremoved if it posed a danger, while
OL,8,FTorus said residents would be consulted
OL,9,Fabout replacement planting.
